---
/**
 * Muted line naming how many sessions the aim sections could not analyse.
 * Reads the `x01Quality` store; hidden at zero.
 */
---

<p
  class="px-1 text-caption text-muted"
  x-show="$store.x01Quality.skipped > 0"
  x-cloak
  x-text="`${$store.x01Quality.skipped} sessions could not be analysed`"
>
</p>
